          "src": "City's lawyers, as reported",
          "cue": "errors"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b07",
      "accent": [
        "1",
        "December"
      ],
      "text": "City lodged an appeal on 1 October. It goes to a new three-person panel. The hearing is expected in the middle of December, and the appeal judgment in the new year.",
